@startuml
title Bobby Jenkins - agreed fishing workflow (not implemented)

state "Setup required" as SetupRequired
state "Ready to cast" as Ready
state "Waiting for bite" as Waiting
state "Barracuda on the line" as OnLine
state "Barracuda caught" as Caught

[*] --> SetupRequired
SetupRequired --> Ready : Equip pole with tackle and bait
Ready --> Waiting : Cast / select wait duration
Waiting --> OnLine : Wait elapses / progress = 0;\nselect required pulls
OnLine --> OnLine : Pull [progress + 1 < threshold]\n/ progress += 1
OnLine --> Caught : Pull [progress + 1 >= threshold]\n/ progress += 1
Caught --> Caught : Query status / HTTP 200\n{"status": "screaming"}
Caught --> SetupRequired : Begin another attempt

note right of Waiting
  Default random wait: 5-10 seconds.
  Select once per cast.
end note

note right of OnLine
  Default required pulls: integer 1-4 inclusive.
  Select once per bite; keep fixed for the catch.
  Uncaught barracuda status queries return HTTP 404.
end note
@enduml
